/**
 * @defgroup libBObol libBObol (BRL-CAD retained scene and display services)
 *
 * libBObol is the typed retained-scene implementation used by drawing-aware
 * libged commands.  A @ref bobol_display endpoint is the only public render
 * attachment boundary.  GED owns shared @ref bobol_scene state, while each
 * endpoint owns one per-view controller and optional native host.
 *
 * The C integration vocabulary and ABI tiers are defined in
 * @ref bobol_c_integration.  libged translates command inputs at its CLI/API
 * boundary and then invokes these services directly; it does not own a second
 * draw-session facade or renderer-side reference registry.
 */

/** @ingroup libBObol
 * @defgroup bobol_display Display endpoints and hosting
 *
 * Endpoint, session, framebuffer, host-factory, window-host, and headless-host
 * contracts.  Endpoint and host mutation is owner-thread-only.  A host is
 * borrowed or owned exactly as stated by the endpoint creation/bind flags.
 */

/** @ingroup libBObol
 * @defgroup bobol_scene Scene and database sources
 *
 * Shared-scene coordination, database source inventory, source-local geometry,
 * placement, and retained scene groups.  Coin graph mutation is performed on
 * the scene/controller owner thread.
 */

/** @ingroup libBObol
 * @defgroup bobol_lod Level of detail and residency
 *
 * Plain-data request/result contracts, cache and residency policy, and the
 * owner-thread publication of worker results.  Worker callbacks must not
 * mutate Coin nodes or global Inventor type state.
 */

/** @ingroup libBObol
 * @defgroup bobol_features Features, polygons, and selection
 *
 * Managed feature, polygon, and selection stores.  Public references are
 * non-owning values containing owner identity, object id, and generation.
 * Every use validates all fields; stale values fail without dereferencing
 * retired storage.
 */

/** @ingroup libBObol
 * @defgroup bobol_query Query and interaction
 *
 * Picking, snapping, measuring, input routing, view queries, and export.
 * Model geometry uses BRL-CAD model units; viewport positions use pixels or
 * the normalized coordinate space explicitly named by the declaration.
 */

/** @ingroup libBObol
 * @defgroup bobol_c_integration C integration and ABI
 *
 * Stable C entry points use the `bobol_` prefix and opaque handles.  The
 * installed stable and advanced header tiers are declared by
 * `include/BObol/api_tiers.cmake`.  Stable C ABI changes require a SOVERSION
 * change; exported Coin/C++ APIs remain source-supported and experimental.
 */
